00:05:13,333 --> 00:05:19,333
What happens in the kitchen ends up on the plate.

2
00:10:26,666 --> 00:10:32,666
Waiting... is a comedy, romance film directed by Rob McKittrick.

3
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:46,000
Young employees at Shenaniganz restaurant collectively stave
off boredom and adulthood with their antics.

4
00:20:53,333 --> 00:20:59,333
Monty, played by Ryan Reynolds.

5
00:26:06,666 --> 00:26:12,666
Serena, played by Anna Faris.

6
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:26,000
Dean, played by Justin Long.

7
00:36:33,333 --> 00:36:39,333
Dan, played by David Koechner.

8
