10
00:52:13,333 --> 00:52:19,333
is a 2005 American comedy film starring Ryan Reynolds, Anna Faris, and
Justin Long as staffers at the restaurant Shenaniganz.

11
00:57:26,666 --> 00:57:32,666
It is directed by Rob McKittrick in his directorial debut.

12
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
McKittrick wrote the screenplay while working as a waiter.

13
01:07:53,333 --> 01:07:59,333
The script was initially sold in a film deal to Artisan Entertainment, but was
released by Lions Gate Entertainment (which purchased Artisan in 2003).

14
01:13:06,666 --> 01:13:12,666
Producers Chris Moore and Jeff Balis of Live Planet's Project
Greenlight fame also took notice of the project and assisted.

15
01:18:20,000 --> 01:18:26,000
The film made over US$6 million, more than twice the
budget of the film, in its opening weekend.

16
01:23:33,333 --> 01:23:39,333
The film explores themes of decision, waiter, hostess,
trainee, employer employee relationship.

17
01:28:46,666 --> 01:28:52,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
